	/// Report only: Title of the Products driver table, e.g. Product categories | where the gap to budget comes from | 2025.
	measure 'Title driver table' = "Product categories | where the " & IF ( [ΔCMP] < 0, "gap to ", "lead over " ) & [Comparison Name] & " comes from | " & MAX ( 'Date'[Year] )
